This project is based on OpenWrt project documentation and forum discussion:

1. "Persistent Ethernet Interface Naming by MAC Address"
   https://openwrt.org/docs/guide-user/base-system/persistent-ethernet-interface-naming-by-mac-address
   (OpenWrt Wiki, licensed CC BY-SA 4.0)

   files/etc/init.d/staticeth is taken from that page essentially verbatim.

2. "Stable network interface names for USB Ethernet Dongles"
   https://forum.openwrt.org/t/stable-network-interface-names-for-usb-ethernet-dongles/98539
   (OpenWrt Forum thread; accepted solution by bobafetthotmail — origin of the wiki page)

3. "Hotplug" — OpenWrt Wiki
   https://openwrt.org/docs/guide-user/base-system/hotplug
   (hotplug "rename interfaces by MAC address" example — basis for
   files/etc/hotplug.d/net/90-staticeth, adapted to read the same
   mapping file as the init script)

